+    "body": "<p>Setup → Timeline &amp; Funding sets optional pre-production/production/post-production dates, custom milestones, opening cash and its as-of date. Use Edit timeline in the visual timeline to change production dates and opening cash. Select Custom milestone or Incoming funding beside Add milestone; both appear on the date axis. Expected and received funding have separate amounts/dates and an expectation does not record receipt.</p><p>Unpaid milestone-relative dates move when their milestone moves. Fixed dates and historical paid dates stay unchanged. Positive offsets mean days after; negative offsets mean days before. Cash Flow is budget-wide: it includes movements on/after the opening date, while earlier movements are already represented by opening cash. Expected funding is not money already in the bank.</p><p>Unallocated costs and undated installments remain <b>Not scheduled yet</b>. Contingency is a reserve, not invented dated spending. A reserve-funded allocation reduces remaining reserve without adding a second payment. Check missing dates and incoming funding before relying on a forecast.</p>"
